veilvoice (0.1.15-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * See CHANGELOG.md in the source for what changed in this release.
    This file exists because dpkg-buildpackage requires it and takes the
    package's version from it, so it is the one place in packaging/ that
    decides what version is built. tools/site-tests/packaging.test.js
    compares it against the workspace version and fails the build if the
    two disagree.

